        "cooked": "<p><em><strong>Anonymous Nominations</strong></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>Unique Capabilities (Top Artist)</em></p><p>Sejixs (for her&nbsp;<a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/comment/89870#comment-89870\">crossover art of Sentinels with Scott Pilgrim</a><span>,&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/comment/103235#comment-103235\">SotM&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/comment/103235#comment-103235\">FF bots&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/comment/103235#comment-103235\">art-by-demand</a><span>, and&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/comment/95703#comment-95703\">Siege-Breaker vs Cursed Acolyte</a><span>)</span></p><p><span>Spiff (for&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/spiffs-gsf-minis-5439\">his GSF minis</a><span>)</span></p><p>svestus (for&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fgreaterthangames.com%2Fforum%2Ftopic%2Fsentinels-of-the-multiverse-the-movie-6688\">Sentinels of the Multiverse: The Movie</a>)</p><p>UXM266 (for 8-bit Sentinels&nbsp;<a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/system/files/forum/attachments/Sentinels%20x4%20p9.png\">Part 1</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/system/files/forum/attachments/Sentinels%20x4%20p8_0.png\">Part 2</a>)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>Exceeded Expectations (Top Contributor)</em></p><p>Powerhound_2000 (for <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/card-spoilers-sheet-crowdsourcing-the-proofreading-6400\">contributions on the card spoilers sheet</a>)</p><p>Spiff (for&nbsp;<span>various things, including FAQs)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>Harmony (Top Debator)</em></p><p>Foote (for various things, including&nbsp;<a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/comment/103825#comment-103825\">contributions on the objectivity discussion</a>)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>Inspiring Presence (Morale Booster)</em></p><p>Arcanist Lupus (for various things, including <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fgreaterthangames.com%2Fcomment%2F104773%23comment-104773\">extended and entertaining limerick posting</a>)</p><p>Reckless (for various things, including <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/comment/103962#comment-103962\">comments in the gender discussion</a>)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>Bolster Allies (Funniest)</em></p><p>Silverleaf (for various things, including <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/i-keep-derailing-threads-6522\">derailing threads</a>)</p><p>Arcanist Lupus</p>",
